  "description": "Count Scrooge Caroldt was once an imperial tutor who betrayed Crown Prince Calsion and was executed, and I woke up in his body! I decided to change my fate by properly guiding the prince and years later, on the night of his coming-of-age ball, I was finally going to retire and live happily ever after. That is, until Calsion ripped up my resignation letter and forced his desires on me...! Now he wants to make me his consort?! I just wanted to retire in peace! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
